{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 74,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        60.617027282714844,
        91.77291107177734,
        72.75702667236328
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        73.62702941894531,
        399.1328125,
        87.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "There was no evidence to support the use of topical antiseptics and steroids in the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        86.62702941894531,
        186.14291381835938,
        100.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "treatment of CSOM in children.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.14559173583984,
        231.48292541503906,
        123.13558959960938
      ],
      "text": "8.4.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        126.80018615722656,
        399.1528625488281,
        140.29019165039062
      ],
      "text": "One systematic review identified two RCTs that included arms which compared the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        139.80018615722656,
        399.10284423828125,
        153.29019165039062
      ],
      "text": "effectiveness of topical antiseptics versus no treatment or placebo [Acuin, 2007].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        152.80018615722656,
        399.1329345703125,
        166.29019165039062
      ],
      "text": "There was low quality evidence that there is no statistically significant difference in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        165.8002166748047,
        399.1128845214844,
        179.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "the rates of treatment failure between topical antiseptic and placebo or no treatment",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        59.6598014831543,
        178.58021545410156,
        157.60983276367188,
        192.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.23",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        178.8002166748047,
        399.1189270019531,
        192.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "( ). However, both studies were underpowered and had some",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        191.8002166748047,
        144.9529266357422,
        205.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "methodological flaws.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        204.8002166748047,
        399.0514831542969,
        218.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "In the first RCT, 60 children with otorrhoea in a hospital clinic in South Africa",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        217.8002166748047,
        399.05279541015625,
        231.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "compared aluminium acetate solutions of varying concentrations (13.00%, 3.25%,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        230.8002166748047,
        399.0628967285156,
        244.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "and 1.30%) [Thorp, 2000]. The most dilute solution was considered to be inactive. The",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        243.8002166748047,
        399.1127624511719,
        257.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "RCT found no significant difference in dry ears after 2 weeks (21 out of 26 patients",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        256.8002014160156,
        399.0726013183594,
        270.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "(81% of ears) with 13.00% aluminium acetate versus 15 out of 20 patients (75%) with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        269.8002014160156,
        399.12274169921875,
        283.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "3.25% aluminium acetate versus 5 out of 10 patients (50%) with 1.30% aluminium",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        282.8002014160156,
        399.09283447265625,
        296.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "acetate; p = 0.18). However, this study may have lacked power to detect a clinically",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        295.8002014160156,
        146.27291870117188,
        309.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "significant difference.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        308.8002014160156,
        399.111572265625,
        322.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "The second RCT included 134 children (180 ears) and compared five interventions:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        321.8002014160156,
        399.05291748046875,
        335.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "ear cleansing alone, ear cleansing plus topical antiseptic, ear cleansing plus topical",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        334.8002014160156,
        396.8504943847656,
        348.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "antiseptic plus topical antibiotics plus corticosteroid, ear cleansing plus topical anti­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        347.8002014160156,
        399.04290771484375,
        361.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "septic plus topical antibiotics plus corticosteroid plus oral antibiotic (clindamycin),",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        360.8002014160156,
        396.8504943847656,
        374.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "and no treatment [Eason, 1986]. It found no significant difference between ear cleans­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        373.8002014160156,
        399.1229248046875,
        387.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "ing plus topical antiseptic (boric acid 2%) 4 times daily and ear cleansing alone in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        386.8002014160156,
        399.0228576660156,
        400.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "the proportion of children with no change in otoscopic appearance after 6 weeks (43",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        399.8002014160156,
        399.1029052734375,
        413.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "children, 58 ears: 12 out of 32 [38%] with topical antiseptic versus 13 out of 26 [50%]",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        412.8002014160156,
        279.86285400390625,
        426.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "with ear cleansing alone; OR 0.61, 95% CI 0.22 to 1.71).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        437.3188171386719,
        163.96286010742188,
        449.3088073730469
      ],
      "text": "8.4.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        452.9635009765625,
        88.77290344238281,
        465.1034851074219
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        465.9734802246094,
        399.0228271484375,
        479.4635009765625
      ],
      "text": "The studies show that there is no added value in using topical antiseptics as they do",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        478.9734802246094,
        399.09283447265625,
        492.4635009765625
      ],
      "text": "not reduce ear discharge compared to placebo. Therefore, they do not have a benefit",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        491.9734802246094,
        134.0928955078125,
        505.4635009765625
      ],
      "text": "in treating CSOM.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        513.4674072265625,
        78.65290069580078,
        525.607421875
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        526.4774169921875,
        399.0729064941406,
        539.9674072265625
      ],
      "text": "The two RCTs gave no information on adverse effects where topical antiseptics were",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        539.4774169921875,
        399.0429382324219,
        552.9674072265625
      ],
      "text": "used compared to placebo. However, in one systematic review of topical antiseptics",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        552.4774169921875,
        399.1029357910156,
        565.9674072265625
      ],
      "text": "versus topical antibiotics, there was increased adverse events (e.g. ear pain, irritation,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        565.4774169921875,
        399.05291748046875,
        578.9674072265625
      ],
      "text": "and bleeding on ear mopping combined; 30 out of 206 [14.6%] with boric acid versus",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        578.4774169921875,
        399.002685546875,
        591.9674072265625
      ],
      "text": "17 out of 210 [8.1%] with ciprofloxacin; Absolute Risk 6.5%, 95% CI 0.3% to 12.7%)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        591.4774169921875,
        399.11297607421875,
        604.9674072265625
      ],
      "text": "[Macfadyen, 2005]. One study also reported cochlear and vestibular otototoxity at",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        604.4774169921875,
        156.6129150390625,
        617.9674072265625
      ],
      "text": "high doses [Perez, 2000].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.37730407714844,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.6663055419922,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "60",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}